{"data":[{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2092498455533072555","created_at":"2026-08-26T06:24:43.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2092498455533072555"],"id":"2092498455533072555","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1303,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"动人的新闻总是先打动现场的记者！ https://t.co/lH2rQAqAPp","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2092498455533072555"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2092495416013316199","created_at":"2026-08-26T06:12:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2092495416013316199"],"id":"2092495416013316199","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":2346,"like_count":17,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":1},"text":"大财和正财，是特别高的能量，人如果不具有太阳一样的正能量，根本驾驭不了财富 ，即便短暂得到，也会被狠狠反噬的体无完肤。普通人只会问哪里可以赚到钱，真正的非池中之物只会想：我的能量在哪里。很多人不配有钱，这句话残酷而现实。","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2092495416013316199"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2092449697218883718","created_at":"2026-08-26T03:10:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2092449697218883718"],"id":"2092449697218883718","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2386,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2091758786470187067","type":"quoted"}],"text":"A股今天涨的最好的还是这2个！券商涨是有降息的预期，国内的政策一直等着老美，老美动完我们就行了！ https://t.co/0Bglo2ZHtg","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2092449697218883718"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2092401663491690667","created_at":"2026-08-26T00:00:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2092401663491690667"],"id":"2092401663491690667","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":10,"impression_count":2428,"like_count":14,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":1},"text":"男人蕞大的恐惧是被羞辱，女人蕞大的恐惧是被抛弃。男频爽文的核心逻辑永远是：弱小被轻视、被羞辱，最终逆袭翻盘、赢回尊重。\n女频爽文的核心冲突，始终围绕被替代、被冷落、被抛弃的不安展开。\n爽文从来不是卖剧情，而是精准捕捉、治愈大众的核心情绪痛点。","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2092401663491690667"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2092284480660926806","created_at":"2026-08-25T16:14:27.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2092284480660926806"],"id":"2092284480660926806","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":1873,"like_count":17,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":1},"text":"终有一天你会静下心来，像个局外人回顾自己的故事，然后笑着摇摇头，浮生不过梦一场，所有能够治愈你的，从来不是时间，而是内心的释怀和明白，人生哪有两全策，短短百年，不过是教人取舍。手持烟火以谋生，且停，且忘，且随风；且行，且看，且从容。该来的都会来，该走的也会走，别抗拒，也别挽留……","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2092284480660926806"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2092209716445512029","created_at":"2026-08-25T11:17:22.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2092209716445512029"],"id":"2092209716445512029","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":5267,"like_count":20,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2092194291959648321","type":"quoted"}],"text":"前1万个粉丝可以跟我一起撒钱，所以还没关注的，抓紧吧，😄 https://t.co/fpgpe0eF04","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2092209716445512029"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2092194291959648321","created_at":"2026-08-25T10:16:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2092194291959648321"],"id":"2092194291959648321","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":5382,"like_count":10,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":11,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2092184992214605993","type":"quoted"}],"text":"如果有一天我赚到100亿呢，我会拿10个亿出来撒钱！ https://t.co/4zo963jdWU","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2092194291959648321"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2092187271030251996","created_at":"2026-08-25T09:48:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2092187271030251996"],"id":"2092187271030251996","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1770,"like_count":9,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":1},"text":"从前听不懂《盛夏的果实》，如今才算真的品出了其中滋味。果实本该等秋风吹熟再摘，可总有人按捺不住心动，在盛夏就匆匆摘下。咬一口，满嘴都